        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions AP-DLW1SMTSBR,  Elegant Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDress up your refrigerator or other appliances with these simply beautiful handles. The Elegant Appliance Pull is available in 2 sizes: 18 inch or 24 inch sizes. Made by First Impressions, these refrigerator handles are part of the Delaware Collection that features traditional designs available in a ton of different finishes so you'll be able to find something that represents your dream kitchen.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available <a href=\"/products/elegant-reed-appliance-pull-first-impressions-ap-dlw1rddsbr\"><b>Elegant Reed Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions AP-DLW1SMTSBR Delaware Appliance Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>These Refrigerator pulls are supplied with countersunk screws for mounting to 3/4\" - 1\" thick panels (standard appliance panel thickness).</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CF8301S-STR-detail.jpg?v=1704354522\"><b>First Impressions AP-DLW1SMTSBR Detailed View</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLW03-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262278\"><b>First Impressions AP-DLW1SMTSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-DLW1018SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 15-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.46\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-DLW1024SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 21-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.46\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This appliance handle is hand assembled in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths and Finishes</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the appliance handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
